        {"kamala_c", new Line("An inspector came. A woman. She looked around for ten minutes, asked me a few questions, and left. She didn't seem interested. She said Priya probably went to visit a friend. But Priya's phone is here. Her wallet is here. What kind of person leaves without their phone?",
