        {"a4b_kamala_1", new Line("They came an hour ago. Two men. They said they were from the Municipal Office, looking for misplaced documents. When I told them I didn't have any documents, they pushed past me and tore the house apart. They were looking for something specific. They kept asking about a file, and a deed.",
