        {"end2_kamala", new Line("Your Honour, I am Kamala Kapoor, Priya's mother. I can testify that my daughter has been threatened, that our home was broken into by agents of the councilor, and that the documents my daughter found are genuine. I may not be a lawyer, but I am a teacher, and I know the difference between truth and lies.",
