        {"b_b", new Line("I couldn't hear clearly, but it sounded like a man. Older. Speaking Hindi with an English accent, you know, the rich people type. Priya madam was saying, I have the documents, you can't stop me. Then later, I know what you did to the records. I don't know what it means, but it sounded serious.",
