        {"b_c", new Line("Now that you mention it... there was a black car. An SUV. It was behind us for a while. I thought it was just traffic, but it turned when I turned. When Priya madam told me to go back, the SUV was gone. Maybe it was nothing. Maybe it wasn't.",
