            new[] { 0.24f, 0.96f, 1.14f, 1.56f, 1.98f, 2.10f, 2.28f, 2.46f, 2.64f, 2.82f, 3.24f })},
        {"v_t2_intro", new Line("Priya is like a daughter to me. I've known her since she was this tall. She came to me three weeks ago. She was investigating the Renewal Project, the one that's going to destroy Basti Nagar. My home, brother. I grew up there. My father built our house with his own hands. And now Councilor Deshpande wants to bulldoze it for a shopping mall.",
