        {"v_t2a", new Line("She found that the land records were forged. The government claims the Basti Nagar land was acquired in 1965 under eminent domain. But Priya found the original deed from 1942. It shows the land was granted to the residents by the Maharaja himself. It was never acquired. The entire Renewal Project is illegal.",
