        {"v_t2b", new Line("Councilor Meghna Deshpande. She is the one behind the project. But it's not just her. There's a builder, Raj Malhotra, and people inside the police. Priya said the corruption goes all the way up. She was scared, but she wouldn't stop. That girl has a spine of steel.",
