        {"v_t3b", new Line("Be careful, Mr. Mehra. The people behind this, they don't play games. Two days ago, two men came to my stall. They asked if a woman had been asking questions about the land records. I said no. They broke my kettle and told me to keep saying no. These are not people you argue with.",
