        {"a5_priya_3", new Line("Five hundred families, Arjun. Children, grandparents, people who've lived in Basti Nagar for generations. They were going to bulldoze everything. And no one was going to stop it. The courts, the police, the politicians. They're all part of the same machine. I had to do this myself.",
