        {"end2_lawyer", new Line("Your Honour, these documents were allegedly stolen from a government facility by a fugitive. The chain of custody is broken. The so-called original deed could itself be a forgery. Without the testimony of the person who obtained these documents, this evidence is inadmissible.",
